#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:4
msgid "Personalized Federated Learning Algorithms"
msgstr "个性化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:6
msgid ""
"In personalized federated learning (PFL), each client seeks a model "
"tailored to its own data distribution while still benefiting from the "
"knowledge of the other clients. A simple and general way to formulate PFL"
" is via *weak consensus*: instead of enforcing full consensus "
":math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots = \\theta_K`, one adds a regularizer "
":math:`\\mathcal{R}` that penalizes the deviation between the local "
"models. This page collects the PFL algorithms (implemented in ``fl_sim`` "
"or closely related) together with their pseudocodes."
msgstr ""
"在个性化联邦学习（Personalized Federated Learning, "
"PFL）中，每个客户端都希望得到适配自身数据分布的模型，同时又能利用其他客户端的知识。表述 PFL 的一种简单而通用的方式是*弱共识*（weak "
"consensus）：不强制完全共识 :math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots = "
"\\theta_K`，而是添加一个惩罚局部模型之间偏差的正则项 :math:`\\mathcal{R}`。本页收集了（在 ``fl_sim`` "
"中实现的或与之密切相关的）PFL 算法及其伪代码。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:16
msgid "``L2SGD``: Loopless Local SGD"
msgstr "``L2SGD``：无环局部随机梯度下降"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:18
msgid ""
"The simplest algorithm of this family is the loopless stochastic gradient"
" descent (Loopless Local SGD, ``L2SGD``) introduced in "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`]. It considers the following weak-"
"consensus problem"
msgstr ""
"这一族算法中最简单的是 [:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 提出的无环随机梯度下降（Loopless "
"Local SGD，``L2SGD``）。它考虑如下弱共识问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:22
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\Theta) = f(\\Theta) + \\lambda \\varphi(\\Theta) \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & f(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K "
"f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"& \\varphi(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert "
"\\theta_k - \\bar{\\theta} \\right\\rVert^2\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - "
"\\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^K \\theta_j \\right\\rVert^2, \\\\\n"
"& \\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K),\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:33
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` is the penalty coefficient and "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta} = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` is the "
"global average model. For :math:`0 < \\lambda < \\infty`, the solution "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` is called a set of "
"*mixed models*. It is easy to see that this problem is equivalent to the "
"problem considered by ``FedProx`` (cf. the constrained problem in the "
":ref:`proximal algorithms section <fl_alg_proximal>`)."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` 为罚参数，:math:`\\bar{\\theta} = "
"\\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` 为全局平均模型。当 :math:`0 < \\lambda < "
"\\infty` 时，解 :math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` "
"被称作一组*混合模型*（mixed models）。容易看出，上述问题与 :ref:`临近算法一节 <fl_alg_proximal>` 中 "
"``FedProx`` 所考察的问题等价。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:40
msgid ""
"Instead of evaluating the full gradient :math:`\\nabla F = \\nabla f + "
"\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi` at every iteration, "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] defines an unbiased stochastic "
"gradient of :math:`F`"
msgstr ""
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 没有在每次迭代都计算完整的梯度 :math:`\\nabla F = "
"\\nabla f + \\lambda \\nabla \\varphi`，而是为 :math:`F` 定义了如下无偏随机梯度"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:44
msgid ""
"G(\\Theta) := \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\frac{\\nabla f(\\Theta)}{1 - p}, & \\text{with probability } 1 - p, "
"\\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi(\\Theta)}{p}, & \\text{with probability "
"} p,\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:52
msgid ""
"with :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`. Note that computing :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta)"
" = \\col(\\nabla f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` is "
"completely block-separable: in the federated setting, this step is "
"carried out locally on the clients without any communication with the "
"server, which is a significant advantage in communication-constrained "
"scenarios. In this sense, ``L2SGD`` already incorporates the *loopless* "
"(skipping) idea; cf. the ``ProxSkip`` algorithm in the :ref:`skipping "
"algorithms section <fl_alg_skipping>`. Under the additional finite-sum "
"assumption :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)`, one"
" can further combine the stochastic gradient with randomized Kaczmarz-"
"type (importance-sampled) updates; see "
"[:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`] for the analysis of loopless "
"methods. The resulting method is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`。注意，计算 :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta) = \\col(\\nabla "
"f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` "
"是完全块分离的：在联邦学习的场景下，这一步只需在客户端本地完成，不涉及与服务器的任何通信，这对以通信为主要瓶颈的联邦学习是巨大的优势。从这个意义上说，``L2SGD``"
" 已经融入了*无环*（跳步）的思想；参见 :ref:`跳步算法一节 <fl_alg_skipping>` 中的 "
"``ProxSkip``。在额外的有限和假设 :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m "
"f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)` 下，还可以进一步把该随机梯度与随机 Kaczmarz 型（重要性采样）更新结合起来；关于无环方法的分析参见"
" [:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`]。由此得到的算法总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:90
msgid "``FPFC``: Fusion Penalized Federated Clustering"
msgstr "``FPFC``：融合惩罚联邦聚类"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:92
msgid ""
"Beyond regularizing the deviation between each pair of *local* models (as"
" in ``L2SGD``) or between the local model and the global one, one can "
"also encourage *clusters* of clients to share identical models, without "
"knowing the clusters a priori. The fusion penalized federated clustering "
"(``FPFC``) algorithm (see `arXiv:2211.04218 "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.04218>`_) achieves this by imposing a "
"nonconvex *pairwise* fusion penalty on the model differences. Introducing"
" the auxiliary variables :math:`\\theta_{ij} \\equiv \\omega_i - "
"\\omega_j` for all pairs :math:`i, j \\in [m]`, it considers"
msgstr ""
"除了在每对*局部*模型之间的偏差（如 ``L2SGD``）或局部模型与全局模型之间的偏差上做正则"
"之外，还可以在*不预先知道簇结构*的情况下，鼓励客户端聚成若干簇、簇内共享同一模型。融合"
"惩罚联邦聚类（``FPFC``）算法（见 `arXiv:2211.04218 "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.04218>`_）通过在模型之差上施加非凸的*成对*融合惩罚来实现这一"
"点。引入辅助变量 :math:`\\theta_{ij} \\equiv \\omega_i - "
"\\omega_j`（:math:`i, j \\in [m]`），它考虑"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:99
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize\\limits_{\\omega, \\theta} & \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m "
"f_i(\\omega_i) + \\frac{1}{2m} \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m "
"\\sum\\limits_{j=1}^m \\tilde{g}(\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert) \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\omega_i - \\omega_j = \\theta_{ij}, \\qquad i, j "
"\\in [m],\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:107
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\tilde{g}(\\cdot)` is a smoothed SCAD-type penalty "
"(parameterized by :math:`\\xi, \\lambda, a`) whose proximal operator "
"shrinks small pairwise differences towards zero (clients in the same "
"cluster) while keeping large ones (clients in different clusters) almost "
"untouched. The problem is solved via an ADMM-style (Douglas--Rachford) "
"splitting with the augmented Lagrangian penalty :math:`\\rho` and dual "
"variables :math:`v_{ij}`: each round, a random subset of devices performs"
" :math:`T_i` local gradient epochs on :math:`f_i(\\omega) + "
"\\frac{\\rho}{2} \\lVert \\omega - \\zeta_i \\rVert^2`, and the server "
"applies the piecewise proximal update to :math:`\\theta_{ij}` and ascends"
" the duals for the pairs of active devices. After training, devices "
":math:`i` and :math:`j` are assigned to the same cluster whenever "
":math:`\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert` is (nearly) zero. The pseudocode is "
"summarized below; note that neither the number of clusters nor the "
"cluster membership needs to be specified in advance."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\tilde{g}(\\cdot)` 是平滑的 SCAD 型罚函数（由 :math:`\\xi, "
"\\lambda, a` 参数化），其近端算子把较小的成对差收缩到零（同簇的客户端），而几乎"
"不动较大的差（不同簇的客户端）。该问题用 ADMM 式（Douglas--Rachford）分裂求解："
"增广拉格朗日罚参数为 :math:`\\rho`，对偶变量为 :math:`v_{ij}`；每一轮，随机选中的"
"一部分设备在 :math:`f_i(\\omega) + \\frac{\\rho}{2} \\lVert \\omega - "
"\\zeta_i \\rVert^2` 上做 :math:`T_i` 个 epoch 的本地梯度下降，服务器对活跃设备"
"的成对变量 :math:`\\theta_{ij}` 施加分段近端更新并做对偶上升。训练结束后，"
":math:`\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert` （近乎）为零的设备 :math:`i` 与 :math:`j` "
"被分到同一个簇。伪代码总结如下；注意，无论簇的个数还是簇的成员关系都不需要事先指定。"

